<title>USA: Jillian's to deregister its stock.</title>
<headline>Jillian's to deregister its stock.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jillian's Entertainment Corp said Friday that it intends to deregister its common stock, which will release it from its obligations to file periodic reorts.</p>
<p>The company said that its stock will be delisted from the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>Jillian's said that it has completed a merger with a unit owned by J.W. Childs Equity Partners.</p>
